#: blocks/notice/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "AI Notice"
msgstr "AI-notis"

#: blocks/notice/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"Disclosure note for AI-written text, as the EU AI Act asks for: a block, an "
"inline note, a dismissible banner, a badge or a button that opens a dialog, "
"with the wording from the TransparAI settings. Shows only when the post has "
"an AI level."
msgstr ""
"Upplysningsnotis för AI-skriven text, som EU AI Act kräver: ett block, en "
"inline-notis, en banner som kan stängas, ett märke eller en knapp som öppnar"
" en dialogruta, med formuleringen från TransparAI-inställningarna. Visas "
"bara när inlägget har en AI-nivå."

#: blocks/notice/block.json blocks/systems-notice/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "transparency"
msgstr "transparens"

#: blocks/systems-list/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "AI Systems List"
msgstr "AI-systemlista"

#: blocks/systems-list/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"A list of the AI systems marked as visible in the TransparAI registry, each "
"with its category. The building block for an AI transparency statement, kept"
" in sync with the registry: a system you add or hide appears or disappears "
"on every page that carries the list."
msgstr ""
"En lista över de AI-system som markerats som synliga i TransparAI-registret,"
" var och en med sin kategori. Byggstenen för en AI-transparensförklaring, "
"som hålls synkroniserad med registret: ett system du lägger till eller "
"döljer visas eller försvinner på varje sida som bär listan."

#: blocks/systems-list/block.json blocks/systems-notice/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "ai systems"
msgstr "ai-system"

#: blocks/systems-list/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "transparency statement"
msgstr "transparensförklaring"

#: blocks/systems-list/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "registry"
msgstr "register"

#: blocks/systems-list/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "list"
msgstr "lista"

#: blocks/systems-notice/block.json
msgctxt "block title"
msgid "AI Systems Notice"
msgstr "AI-systemnotis"

#: blocks/systems-notice/block.json
msgctxt "block description"
msgid ""
"One sentence naming the AI systems this site uses, taken from the TransparAI"
" registry: chatbots, recommendations, image generation, translation. For the"
" imprint, the privacy policy or a transparency page. Shows only when at "
"least one system is marked as visible."
msgstr ""
"En mening som namnger de AI-system den här webbplatsen använder, hämtad från"
" TransparAI-registret: chattbotar, rekommendationer, bildgenerering, "
"översättning. För företagsinformationen, integritetspolicyn eller en "
"transparenssida. Visas bara när minst ett system är markerat som synligt."

#: blocks/systems-notice/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "privacy policy"
msgstr "integritetspolicy"

#: blocks/systems-notice/block.json
msgctxt "block keyword"
msgid "imprint"
msgstr "företagsinformation"
